# Telegram Bot agent

## Scope

- `bot/` package, telegram services, Mini App hub template
- WebApp auth bridge / openLink / mode switching in `telegram-webapp.js`

## Does not own

- Look & feel, tokens, layout CSS — **Visual** owns `tg-webapp.css` and shared UI
- If a change needs both logic + CSS: implement logic here, hand CSS to Visual (or one PR with Visual rules applied)

## Rules

- Prefer SITE_INTERNAL_URL for server-side calls from bot container.
- Do not break sticky scroll shell (`#tg-scroll-root`) when touching JS.

## DoD

- Bot commands and Mini App entry still work.
- No secrets logged. Tests in `tests/test_phase*_telegram*` / mini_app when relevant.
